        "title": "Keep one state while doing an action",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Verb + 着 can describe the accompanying state during a later action by the same person. 带着本子去 means go with the notebook, not finish carrying it and then go without it.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我带着本子去学校。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ dài zhe běnzi qù xuéxiào 。",
                "meaning": "I go to school with my notebook.",
